        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K539, Rectangular Quaker Collection Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design, this latchset is made from cast brass. It can be paired with any of the knobs or levers made by Brass Accents. It is 2-1/4 inches wide and 7 inches tall. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy function in any of the wide array of finishes. The Quaker Solid Brass Latchset includes matching mounting hardware for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D07-K539 Quaker Collection Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Quaker Solid Brass Latchset, Brass Accents D07-K539",
                "description": "Brass Accents D07-K539, Quaker Solid Brass Latchset - Simple in design, this latchset is made from cast brass. It can be paired with any of the knobs or levers made by Brass Accents. It is 2-1/4 inches wide and 7 inches tall. Choose from dummy, passage, privacy function in any of the wide array of finishes. The Quaker Solid Brass Latchset includes matching mounting hardware for easy installation.\r\n",
